@startuml State_After_Class

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam classBackgroundColor white
skinparam classBorderColor #666666
skinparam classArrowColor #666666
skinparam classFontSize 11
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam stereotypeCBackgroundColor #AADDFF

skinparam class {
    FontStyle bold
    HeaderBackgroundColor #E8E8E8
}

title **Class Diagram After Refactoring - State Pattern**

package "State Pattern" {
    interface IPlayerState <<State>> {
        + enter(player : Player*) : void
        + update(player : Player*, delta : float) : void
        + exit(player : Player*) : void
        + handleMoveStart(player : Player*, direction : string) : IPlayerState*
        + handleMoveStop(player : Player*, direction : string) : IPlayerState*
        + getStateName() : string
    }

    class IdleState <<ConcreteState>> {
        + {static} getInstance() : IdleState*
        + enter(player : Player*) : void
        + update(player : Player*, delta : float) : void
        + exit(player : Player*) : void
        + handleMoveStart(...) : IPlayerState*
        + handleMoveStop(...) : IPlayerState*
    }

    class WalkingState <<ConcreteState>> {
        + {static} getInstance() : WalkingState*
        + enter(player : Player*) : void
        + update(player : Player*, delta : float) : void
        + exit(player : Player*) : void
        + handleMoveStart(...) : IPlayerState*
        + handleMoveStop(...) : IPlayerState*
    }

    class PlayerStateContext {
        - _player : Player*
        - _currentState : IPlayerState*
        __
        + setPlayer(player : Player*) : void
        + changeState(newState : IPlayerState*) : void
        + getCurrentState() : IPlayerState*
        + update(delta : float) : void
        + handleMoveStart(direction : string) : void
        + handleMoveStop(direction : string) : void
    }
}

class Player <<Context>> {
    - _stateContext : PlayerStateContext*
    __
    + onMoveStart(direction : string) : void
    + onMoveStop(direction : string) : void
    + update(delta : float) : void
}

IPlayerState <|.. IdleState
IPlayerState <|.. WalkingState
PlayerStateContext --> IPlayerState : _currentState
PlayerStateContext --> Player : _player
Player --> PlayerStateContext : uses

IdleState ..> WalkingState : transitions to
WalkingState ..> IdleState : transitions to

note right of IPlayerState
  Benefits:
  + State logic encapsulated in classes
  + Easy to add new states
  + Explicit state transitions
  + Single Responsibility per state
  + Open for extension
end note

@enduml
